#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:6
msgid "Windows Environment Setup"
msgstr "Windows 环境搭建"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:8
msgid ""
"This document details the complete steps to set up the UniSDK development"
" environment on Windows 10/11."
msgstr ""
"本文档详细介绍了在 Windows 10/11 上搭建 UniSDK 开发环境的完整步骤。"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:10
msgid "System Requirements"
msgstr "系统要求"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:12
msgid "Windows 10 (1709+) or Windows 11"
msgstr "Windows 10 (1709+) 或 Windows 11"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:13
msgid "At least 4 GB RAM, 8 GB+ recommended"
msgstr "至少 4 GB RAM，建议 8 GB 以上"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:14
msgid "Administrator privileges (recommended)"
msgstr "管理员权限（推荐）"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:16
msgid "Installation Methods"
msgstr "安装方法"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:18
msgid "Method 1: One-Click Setup Script (Recommended)"
msgstr "方法 1：一键安装脚本（推荐）"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:20
msgid ""
"UniSDK provides an automated deployment script (`windows_setup.ps1`) that"
" simplifies the environment configuration process on Windows systems."
msgstr ""
"UniSDK 提供了一个自动化部署脚本（`windows_setup.ps1`），可简化 Windows 系统上的环境配置过程。"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:22
msgid "Open PowerShell as Administrator"
msgstr "以管理员身份打开 PowerShell"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:23
msgid "Navigate to the scripts directory and run:"
msgstr "导航至脚本目录并运行："

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:30
msgid "Script Features in Detail"
msgstr "脚本功能详解"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:32
msgid "The script automatically performs the following tasks:"
msgstr "该脚本自动执行以下任务："

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:34
msgid "**PowerShell Execution Policy Configuration**"
msgstr "**PowerShell 执行策略配置**"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:35
msgid ""
"Checks and sets the execution policy to `RemoteSigned` to allow running "
"local scripts"
msgstr "检查并将执行策略设置为 `RemoteSigned`，以允许运行本地脚本"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:37
msgid "**Tool Installation**"
msgstr "**工具安装**"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:38
msgid "Detects if `winget` is installed"
msgstr "检测是否安装了 `winget`"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:39
msgid ""
"If winget is available: automatically downloads and installs CMake, "
"Ninja, Python, and Git"
msgstr ""
"如果 winget 可用：自动下载并安装 CMake、Ninja、Python 和 Git"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:40
msgid ""
"If winget is not available: provides official download links to guide "
"manual installation"
msgstr ""
"如果 winget 不可用：提供官方下载链接以引导手动安装"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:42
msgid "**Python Environment Configuration**"
msgstr "**Python 环境配置**"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:43
msgid "Creates `.venv` virtual environment in the UniSDK root directory"
msgstr "在 UniSDK 根目录下创建 `.venv` 虚拟环境"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:44
msgid "Upgrades pip to the latest version"
msgstr "将 pip 升级到最新版本"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:45
msgid "Installs all Python dependencies from `requirements.txt`"
msgstr "从 `requirements.txt` 安装所有 Python 依赖"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:46
msgid "Ensures west tool is properly installed"
msgstr "确保 west 工具已正确安装"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:48
msgid "**Environment Variable Settings**"
msgstr "**环境变量设置**"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:49
msgid "Sets `TELINK_TOOLCHAIN_PATH` pointing to the toolchain directory"
msgstr "设置 `TELINK_TOOLCHAIN_PATH` 指向工具链目录"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:50
msgid "Adds CMake and Ninja paths to the system PATH"
msgstr "将 CMake 和 Ninja 路径添加到系统 PATH"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:52
msgid "**Telink Toolchain Setup**"
msgstr "**Telink 工具链设置**"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:53
msgid "Creates the `toolchain` directory"
msgstr "创建 `toolchain` 目录"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:54
msgid "Sets `TELINK_TOOLCHAIN_PATH` environment variable"
msgstr "设置 `TELINK_TOOLCHAIN_PATH` 环境变量"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:55
msgid ""
"Due to special permissions required for toolchain download, users need to"
" manually download and extract the toolchain"
msgstr "由于工具链下载需要特殊权限，用户需要手动下载并解压工具链"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:57
msgid "**West Workspace Initialization**"
msgstr "**West 工作空间初始化**"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:58
msgid "Initializes the west workspace by executing `west init -l`"
msgstr "通过执行 `west init -l` 初始化 west 工作空间"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:60
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "日志记录"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:62
msgid ""
"The script automatically generates a `setup_log.txt` file in the script "
"directory, recording detailed logs of the entire configuration process "
"for troubleshooting purposes."
msgstr ""
"脚本会在脚本目录下自动生成 `setup_log.txt` 文件，记录整个配置过程的详细日志，以便故障排查。"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:64
msgid ""
"!!! note \"Toolchain Requires Manual Download\"     Since toolchain "
"download requires special permissions, the script only creates the "
"`toolchain` directory and sets the environment variable.     Please "
"manually download the toolchain and extract it to the "
"`<unisdk>\\toolchain` directory.     Download link: "
"https://drive.weixin.qq.com/s?k=AKwA0AfNAA8Ox1r0ab"
msgstr ""
"!!! note \"工具链需要手动下载\"     由于工具链下载需要特殊权限，脚本仅创建 `toolchain` 目录并设置环境变量。     请手动下载工具链并将其解压到 `<unisdk>\\toolchain` 目录。     下载链接：https://drive.weixin.qq.com/s?k=AKwA0AfNAA8Ox1r0ab"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:69
msgid "Method 2: Manual Installation"
msgstr "方法 2：手动安装"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:71
msgid "1. Install System Dependencies"
msgstr "1. 安装系统依赖"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:73
msgid "Use winget for one-click installation:"
msgstr "使用 winget 一键安装："

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:79
msgid "Or manually download and install if winget is not supported:"
msgstr "如果不支持 winget，请手动下载并安装："

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:81
msgid "[CMake](https://cmake.org/download/) — Check \"Add CMake to PATH\""
msgstr "[CMake](https://cmake.org/download/) — 勾选 \"Add CMake to PATH\""

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:82
msgid ""
"[Ninja](https://github.com/ninja-build/ninja/releases) — Manually add to "
"PATH"
msgstr ""
"[Ninja](https://github.com/ninja-build/ninja/releases) — 手动添加到 PATH"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:83
msgid ""
"[Python](https://www.python.org/downloads/) — Check \"Add Python.exe to "
"PATH\""
msgstr ""
"[Python](https://www.python.org/downloads/) — 勾选 \"Add Python.exe to PATH\""

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:84
msgid "[Git](https://git-scm.com/downloads)"
msgstr "[Git](https://git-scm.com/downloads)"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:86
msgid "Verify installation:"
msgstr "验证安装："

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:95
msgid "2. Set Up Python Virtual Environment"
msgstr "2. 搭建 Python 虚拟环境"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:114
msgid "3. Initialize West"
msgstr "3. 初始化 West"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:120
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If you encounter the error `already initialized in {where}, aborting.`, "
"temporarily unset `ZEPHYR_BASE`:"
msgstr ""
"如果遇到错误 `already initialized in {where}, aborting.`，请临时取消设置 `ZEPHYR_BASE`："

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:126
msgid "4. Configure Toolchain"
msgstr "4. 配置工具链"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:136
msgid "Configure BDT Tool (Optional)"
msgstr "配置 BDT 工具（可选）"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:146
msgid "Verify Environment"
msgstr "验证环境"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:153
msgid "Common Issues"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:155
msgid "PowerShell Script Cannot Execute"
msgstr "PowerShell 脚本无法执行"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:161
msgid "Environment Variables Not Taking Effect"
msgstr "环境变量未生效"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:163
msgid "Restart the terminal, VS Code, or the system"
msgstr "重启终端、VS Code 或系统"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:164
msgid "Check system environment variable settings"
msgstr "检查系统环境变量设置"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:165
msgid ""
"If the previous step doesn't solve the problem, manually check if the "
"PATH contains the correct path and add it to the user's PATH"
msgstr ""
"如果上一步未解决问题，请手动检查 PATH 是否包含正确的路径，并将其添加到用户 PATH 中"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:167
msgid "Arrow Keys Not Working in menuconfig Within VS Code"
msgstr "在 VS Code 的 menuconfig 中方向键无法使用"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:169
msgid "Use letter keys instead of arrow keys"
msgstr "使用字母键代替方向键"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:170
msgid "Use Windows 11"
msgstr "使用 Windows 11"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:171
msgid "Use CMD instead of PowerShell for menuconfig operations"
msgstr "使用 CMD 代替 PowerShell 进行 menuconfig 操作"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:173
msgid "winget Installation Failure"
msgstr "winget 安装失败"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:175
msgid "Check Windows version (requires Windows 10 1709 or higher)"
msgstr "检查 Windows 版本（需要 Windows 10 1709 或更高版本）"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:176
msgid "Try installing App Installer from Microsoft Store"
msgstr "尝试从 Microsoft Store 安装 App Installer"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:178
msgid "Python Dependencies Installation Failure"
msgstr "Python 依赖安装失败"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:180
msgid "Ensure network connection is working"
msgstr "确保网络连接正常"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:181
msgid "Proxy server settings might be needed"
msgstr "可能需要配置代理服务器设置"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:183
msgid "CMake or Ninja Not Found"
msgstr "找不到 CMake 或 Ninja"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:185
msgid "Manually check installation paths"
msgstr "手动检查安装路径"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:186
msgid ""
"The script will attempt to automatically find common installation "
"locations, but may require manual addition to PATH"
msgstr ""
"脚本会尝试自动查找常见的安装位置，但可能需要手动添加到 PATH"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:188
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:190
msgid ""
"**Administrator Privileges**: While not strictly necessary, it's "
"recommended to run the script as administrator to ensure proper "
"environment variable settings"
msgstr ""
"**管理员权限**：虽然不是必须的，但建议以管理员身份运行脚本，以确保环境变量设置正确"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:191
msgid ""
"**Environment Variables Effectiveness**: After script completion, open a "
"new PowerShell window to apply all environment variable changes"
msgstr ""
"**环境变量生效**：脚本完成后，打开一个新的 PowerShell 窗口以使所有环境变量更改生效"

#: ../../source/developing/setup_windows.md:192
msgid ""
"**Virtual Environment Activation**: Use the following command to activate"
" the virtual environment:"
msgstr ""
"**虚拟环境激活**：使用以下命令激活虚拟环境："

